---
title: Pre-release — Google Calendar, Notion and Tasks
version: Pre-release
releaseDate: 2026-06-20
type: New
---
- Google Calendar two-way sync: event listing and slot creation
- Notion integration: import pages and blocks
- Tasks: new tabbed UI with multi-select
- Tasks: keyboard shortcut for quick-create task dialog
- Tasks: multi-day all-day events span correctly on calendar
- Tasks: Meet guest field added
- Notification routing directly to relevant task/channel
- Workspace visibility restrictions
- Circular status icons for tasks
- Sarvam AI speech-to-text for meeting transcription
